WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Come in.

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:08.500
Sorry to call you out so late.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.790
But he's a night person.

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:16.160
Nice to meet you. We've never met...

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:16.160
have we, Ichiru Kiryu?

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:20.250
What does the Dorm President

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:20.250
of Moon Dormitory want with me?

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.370
Do you intend to make me

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:24.370
a pawn in your little games?

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:29.450
Humph... You're already

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:29.450
on the game board.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.370
Who's your target?

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:35.660
Even if you knew,

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:35.660
there's nothing you can do, is there?

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:39.910
If I'm an eyesore,

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:39.910
go ahead and get rid of me.

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:35.080
THE FAKE LOVERS

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:35.080
It takes courage to admit a student

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:37.040
THE FAKE LOVERS

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:37.040
whom you know will add fuel to the fire.

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:40.700
Are you anxious about

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:40.700
admitting him into the academy?

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:42.620
No, just...

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:46.790
This is the place where you are

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:46.790
hoping to achieve the ideal peace.

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:50.200
I have no intention

00:02:47.040 --> 00:02:50.200
of destroying your dream.

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:52.870
I have faith in you.

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:59.540
I want to fulfill her dream,

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:59.540
no matter what I must do.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.160
On top of which,

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:08.410
I've promised to hand over

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:08.410
all matters concerning vampires to you.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:12.040
But frankly, I was shocked about Yuki.

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.290
To ask her to be your lover...?

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:16.750
Kaname!

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:20.700
If you make Yuki cry,

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:20.700
I will never forgive you!

00:03:23.080 --> 00:03:24.080
Kaname?

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:26.540
You don't seem too happy.

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:29.750
No, I'm happy. Very happy.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:32.250
<i>Now, finally...</i>

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:42.700
<i>Become my lover.</i>

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:49.120
<i>We're going to become</i>

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:49.120
<i>like Mom and Dad.</i>

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.870
<i>You shall be mine.</i>

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:58.290
Yuki?

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.000
My head...hurts...

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.080
Yuki...

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:12.370
Are you really all right?

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:12.370
You didn't eat breakfast.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.000
Uh-huh.

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:17.040
If you don't feel well,

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:17.040
you should rest.

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:20.870
I'm fine. I just have a lot on my mind.

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:24.370
And I got stressed out.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.580
What would get you stressed out?

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.200
Huh? Oh...Zero.

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:35.660
'Morning!

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.250
Hey...

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:41.450
Good morning.

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:43.040
'Morning.

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.870
What're you doing, the both of you?

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:48.540
U-umm.

00:04:50.080 --> 00:04:51.250
Let's go, Yuki.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:52.790
Uh-huh...

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:00.040
Wha?

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:02.330
It's Dorm President Kuran's orders.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:07.040
He wants us to stay

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:07.040
by you as bodyguards.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:10.750
Lady Yuki...

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.830
Y-Yes? What is it?

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.620
Did you do something

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.620
to upset someone Yuki?

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:18.950
N-No...

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:20.370
Let's go.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.830
Huh...?! They're following.

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:29.830
Is this a new form of bullying?

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:32.200
Hey?! What is this?

00:05:30.540 --> 00:05:32.200
What's going on?!

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.080
It's just that

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.080
Disciplinary Committee again...

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.790
No fair!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.790
It's always only Cross!

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:42.580
Excuse me! Kaname may have

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:42.580
ordered this or whatever...

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:44.870
I wish you'd think about who

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:44.870
you're doing this to, and the place!

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:47.200
Shut up, Yuki Cross...

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:49.200
Lady.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:53.700
If our Pureblood Prince Kaname

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:53.700
has decided that you are special...

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:57.040
Then we must treat you special too.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:00.870
A human girl like you

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:00.870
probably won't understand...

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:04.160
But that is the dignified way

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:04.160
of aristocrats like us.

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:12.250
All right, everyone,

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:12.250
solve this problem.

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:17.370
<i>Why did Kaname go this far?</i>

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:20.040
<i>Become my lover.</i>

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:23.870
Lover? Kaname's?

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:26.250
<i>Be...mine!</i>

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:31.950
Yuki!

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:33.830
What's wrong, Cross?!

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:37.450
INFIRMARY

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:39.580
Are you all right?

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:45.540
Yes. It's just lack of sleep.

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:45.540
I've had so much on my mind.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:51.870
I'm sorry.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:51.870
I'm always making you worry.

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:54.000
Don't worry about me.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:55.450
But...

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:59.700
This is what it means

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:59.700
to have to stand next to him.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:04.500
You are prepared

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:04.500
to confront him, right?

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:07.700
Uh-huh.

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:10.040
Okay then.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.790
<i>This guy...is Kiryu's...</i>

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.250
<i>If my memory serves,</i>

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:02.250
<i>he was with the Senate.</i>

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:06.750
Hold it!

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:09.870
There's a girl lying down in there.

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:13.040
So I need permission

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:13.040
to enter the infirmary?

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:17.830
I just need some medicine.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:41.290
<i>You are the one person</i>

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:41.290
<i>I will not turn into a vampire.</i>

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:51.080
<i>I, too, have someone...I don't want to</i>

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:51.080
<i>turn into a vampire, no matter what.</i>

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.000
What are you doing?

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:01.870
Zero?

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:07.750
I'll take whatever is in your hand.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:12.700
Huh? Ichiru? What is it?

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.450
Such a pampered life...

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.450
You don't even know what's going on.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.330
I will report this to Lord Kaname.

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:22.250
Do whatever you wish.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:25.750
Huh?!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.000
Humph...

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:31.330
I see... Ichiru Kiryu had that?

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:32.580
Yes.

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:33.870
You did well to stop him.

00:09:34.370 --> 00:09:36.250
I'm honored to be of assistance.

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:40.700
Umm... Whose blood is that?

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.160
I'm sorry...

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.160
That's none of my business.

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:48.700
No, that's all right.

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:48.700
But don't mention this to anyone.

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:53.370
With regards to Ichiru Kiryu, I have

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:53.370
no intention of dealing with him personally.

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:54.450
Huh?!

00:09:54.750 --> 00:09:57.040
He has his own role to play.

00:09:57.830 --> 00:10:01.870
But if he should do something to...

00:09:57.830 --> 00:10:01.870
Lady Yuki...

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.540
And that's why I want you

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.540
to guard her well.

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.040
If that is what Lord Kaname wishes...

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:10.540
Umm...

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:14.870
And about Ruka...

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:19.120
I see... She hasn't left her room?

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:20.790
Yes.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:26.870
It's ever since she learned

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:26.870
that Lady Yuki...is your lover.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:31.160
That's fine. Let her be.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:32.660
Yes.

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:34.450
Aido...

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:39.040
About Yuki... I really thank you.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.660
Oh... Don't mention it.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:54.750
I won't let you fulfill your wish

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:54.750
with such vile, tainted blood.

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:08.160
I wanted to talk to you.

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:11.620
Has my punishment

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:11.620
been decided upon?

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:13.870
Punishment?

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:15.250
Isn't what this is about?

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:16.700
Then what is it?

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:19.450
There's only one thing

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:19.450
I need to tell you...

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:23.160
Come to...dinner tonight!

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.830
Zero and Yuki will be here too.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:31.450
Many things have happened,

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:31.450
but you and Zero are still twins.

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:38.950
I believe that the both of you can

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:38.950
choose a different way of life.

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:02.790
Lord Kaname isn't planning on

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:02.790
dealing with you. But remember this...

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:06.330
I won't let you lay a hand

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:06.330
on Yuki Cross again.

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:11.910
You do that...

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:18.910
Huh?

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.330
Yuki, can I come in?

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:21.450
Uh-huh.

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:25.410
Classes are over.

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:25.410
Are you up to eating something?

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:28.540
Dorm President Kuran wants

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:28.540
to see you. Come with me.

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:30.330
- Huh?

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:30.330
- Kiryu, you too.

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:38.290
Yuki Cross, I understand you have

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:38.290
no memories of the past.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:41.330
That's right. Why do you ask?

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:43.750
I did a little investigating.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:45.250
Huh?!

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:50.330
Aido, you looked into my past?

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:50.330
I didn't even ask you to! Are you--?!

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:55.040
No! I wouldn't look into your past

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:55.040
even if I was asked to!

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:58.620
What I investigated

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:58.620
is Lord Kaname's past.

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:04.200
You're aware that

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:04.200
his parents passed away?

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.290
I looked into their deaths.

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:13.040
Even if I found leads, inevitably,

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:13.040
records were erased or burned.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:18.500
Everything had been deliberately

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:18.500
covered up. Like your memory.

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:23.870
Taking a common girl

00:13:21.330 --> 00:13:23.870
like you for a lover

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:26.000
and giving you

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:26.000
such special treatment...

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:27.830
Do you know the reason for that?

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:33.250
So that he can order us

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:33.250
to protect you.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:39.790
Lord Kaname knows...

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:39.790
that you face impending danger.

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:45.950
This is as far as I go.

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:48.870
Just make sure you're not rude.

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:54.250
Oh...

00:13:58.200 --> 00:13:59.200
Yuki...

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:02.040
Finally, we can

00:14:00.580 --> 00:14:02.040
spend time with each other.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:04.410
Come here.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:11.750
There's no need to act reserved

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:11.750
with me anymore. Come.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:13.660
<i>Kaname...</i>

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:19.160
<i>No!</i>

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:25.330
Standing so far away...

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:25.330
I guess you're still not used to the idea?

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:32.790
You didn't have to

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:32.790
come outside so early.

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:34.450
It's all right.

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:36.870
<i>Don't let him deter me!</i>

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:40.620
I see... Your imagination

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:40.620
is running wild.

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:44.870
I won't ask that much of you so soon.

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:47.580
Umm...! Kaname!

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:49.200
What is it?

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:51.250
You didn't like the snacks?

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:57.500
You promised. Please tell me

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:57.500
about my missing past.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:01.830
Not now. I don't want to tell you

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:01.830
when you look so fierce.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:05.040
I knew you were going to

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:05.040
evade the question like that!

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:09.000
Well then,

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:09.000
I'll just imagine my own past!

00:15:12.370 --> 00:15:13.950
You look bored, Kiryu.

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:18.450
May I ask you to chase away

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:18.450
the Day Class students?

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:24.870
Thanks. That's much better.

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:32.000
Yuki, I heard you're not feeling well?

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:32.000
Are you all right?

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:38.950
Oh, err, yes. No... I had so much on

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:38.950
my mind, I haven't had enough sleep.

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:40.450
And so...

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:43.000
Have you been

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:43.000
thinking about me?

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:50.450
Then I'm happy that

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:50.450
you're thinking of me, Yuki.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:56.660
I'm going to give the Night Class

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:56.660
a few days off.

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:57.870
Huh?

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:00.370
Then night patrol won't be necessary.

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:02.620
So please get your rest.

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:04.370
You can't...!

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:08.160
Otherwise, I'll be

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:08.160
too worried to sleep.

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:14.660
<i>Lord Kaname knows...</i>

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:14.660
<i>that you face impending danger.</i>

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.700
<i>...you can choose</i>

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:24.700
<i>a different way of life.</i>

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:30.410
Welcome, Ichiru!

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.540
I just went out to pick vegetables.

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:37.040
They're really fresh!

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:37.040
Now, go on inside.

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:42.370
I've waited for this

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:42.370
for a long time.

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:49.160
<i>It's as though we're playing</i>

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:49.160
<i>the part of a happy couple.</i>

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:51.450
The sun is setting.

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:55.200
I hate to lose you,

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:55.200
but you have to go back soon.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:58.500
You need your rest.

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:04.080
<i>Seems as if he's enjoying</i>

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:04.080
<i>every minute of it until the curtain falls.</i>

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:07.870
<i>Why do I feel this way?</i>

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:11.160
<i>I yearned for him to look at me.</i>

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:15.370
<i>I always, always loved him, but...</i>

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:17.370
What's the matter?

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:25.700
I don't understand...

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:25.700
why you keep behaving this way.

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.000
I wish you would understand.

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:37.160
All right, now can you mix this?

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:40.330
Make sure you don't

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:40.330
overcook the white sauce.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:48.790
Zero eats anything,

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:48.790
but I still don't know what he likes.

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.370
Do you know, Ichiru?

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:53.040
Huh?

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:57.450
<i>You can have it.</i>

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:57.450
<i>You like this, don't you?</i>

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:59.290
<i>You like it too, Ichiru.</i>

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:03.660
<i>I'm giving back to you...</i>

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:03.660
<i>because you're always kind to me.</i>

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:09.080
Well, if you don't know...

00:18:09.910 --> 00:18:10.910
Vegetable soup.

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:12.120
Huh?

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:18.000
Oh, I forgot about the soup!

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:18.000
Maybe I'll make vegetable soup.

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:20.830
Let's see...vegetables...

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:28.290
I know tomatoes! Tomato soup

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:28.290
is good, don't you think?

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:32.370
Are you all right?

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:37.450
Hmm? Oh, yes. Although, I feel like

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:37.450
he avoided the subject again.

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:40.700
Sorry, I made you come too.

00:18:41.040 --> 00:18:42.040
It's okay.

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:47.660
But, just remember this...

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:51.870
Even if that's what he wants,

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:51.870
I'm totally against it.

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:53.160
Huh?

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:57.120
<i>If I become a vampire,</i>

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:57.120
<i>do you think I would feel stronger?</i>

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:00.040
<i>I won't let you become such a thing.</i>

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:04.120
<i>Zero's menacing look, which he</i>

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:04.120
<i>so desperately tries to repress,</i>

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:06.910
<i>pierces painfully through me.</i>

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:10.540
<i>I can't let Zero suffer</i>

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:10.540
<i>any more than this!</i>

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:13.370
Welcome home!

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.290
We have a special menu tonight!

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:17.750
Ichiru?!

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:19.540
I invited him.

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:22.750
You should let go

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:22.750
once in a while...

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:25.870
You two are twins,

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:25.870
after all. Right?

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:31.580
Umm...

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:34.500
You two really are identical.

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:39.620
Earlier at the infirmary, I was still fuzzy

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:39.620
with sleep and mistook you for Zero.

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:40.700
Huh?!

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:43.910
Did you try to do

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:43.910
something to Yuki?!

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:46.750
Zero, stop it!

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:50.370
Tadah! Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:51.540
- I'm leaving.

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:51.540
- Now, now...

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.290
Huh? Dinner is...

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:56.370
It's useless... It's too late

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:56.370
to choose another way to live.

00:19:57.370 --> 00:20:00.540
Huh? Huh? Huh?!

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:04.450
My special menu!

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:07.000
We'll eat it.

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:10.370
Right, Zero? Before it gets cold?

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:18.040
What's wrong?

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:19.330
Nothing.

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:24.910
Sorry.

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:29.750
Just because I said such

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:29.750
a stupid thing, Ichiru...

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.000
It's not your fault.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:36.080
Still... And it's not only that.

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:43.540
You and Ichiru too... Both of you

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:43.540
have had many sad experiences.

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:47.750
So I just don't want you to

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:47.750
keep on hurting each other.

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:50.700
The Headmaster said that too...

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.160
Does your head hurt again?

00:20:57.910 --> 00:21:01.370
No, I'm all right. It's not bad.

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:05.330
Forget our problems.

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:05.330
You need to get some rest.

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:07.620
I'm sorry.

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:10.000
Good night.

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:16.250
You should forget that girl.

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:21.830
Your tastes have gotten bad.

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:25.450
What is your real motive?

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:27.700
I don't owe you an explanation.

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:36.000
We're almost there, Shiki.

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:37.750
Yeah.

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:44.830
When the real head of family appears,

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:44.830
I wonder how you will react...

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:47.160
that fake successor...

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:07.250
Oh, I'm tired.

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:09.790
Making me do weird things...

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:19.330
Shiki?

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:19.330
Where've you been all this time?

00:22:20.330 --> 00:22:21.330
Huh?

00:22:22.410 --> 00:22:24.160
Who...are you?

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:03.450
Next time:

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:03.450
"The Kiss of Thorns"
